# Names only. Never put a value in this file.
#
# Browser (Vite inlines only VITE_-prefixed names into the client bundle). Both are public by design:
# the Clerk publishable key and the Supabase publishable (anon) key. Row security protects the data.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Server only. Phase 0 has no server functions, so none is needed yet. Listed so nobody gives one a
# VITE_ prefix by mistake: these must never reach the browser bundle (npm run check:bundle).
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
